# Credentials. Never commit.
.env

# Contains full questions and answers — operational data, not source.
logs/

# data/chunks.json and data/vocab.yaml ARE committed here — deliberately,
# unlike the monorepo's own copies. This repo has no kg_build/ and cannot
# regenerate them; without a copy checked in, there is nothing for the
# Dockerfile to bake into the image and nothing for the app to serve (this
# is exactly the failure a hosting platform hits if they're missing:
# RuntimeError: search index missing at chunks.json).
#
# in the monorepo checkout, backend/logs is a directory JUNCTION (Windows)
# pointing at the real Compliance-Assistant-level logs/ — see the setup note
# in README.md. That one is fine to stay ignored: it's write-only runtime
# state, never a build input.
data/*.pdf
data/overrides.yaml
data/plain_language.json

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
